{"unit_id":"sd1g1__dsh-minimal-bash-fix#card-zh","repo":"sd1g1/dsh-minimal-bash-fix","commit":"654c64baf04b5311c5cd5552b1bd8262b06b14dd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-minimal-bash-fix 为 DSH Web profile 提供 minimal-fast preset，改善持久 Bash 命令完成延迟。启动时会把 preset 同步到用户目录，并安装 dsh-bashrc；文件内容相同则不重写。preset 使用自定义 Bash rcfile、dsh> 提示符和 10 毫秒轮询间隔。适合仍遇到 minimal 模式 Bash 延迟的用户。需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本；DSH_HOME 可指定 DSH 根目录，默认是 ~/.dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:27-42","lib/index.js:45-74","preset/agent.cordis.yml:20-35","dsh-bashrc:1-4","cordis.patch.yml:10-12"]}
